WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.500
Try to use every street once, from two different starts.

2
00:00:04.249 --> 00:00:07.124
Start at A and drive once round the outside.

3
00:00:16.526 --> 00:00:19.176
Back at A, with two streets left. Stuck.

4
00:00:21.256 --> 00:00:24.056
Start at B instead. Every street, once.
